Package: dtaMetaBridge
Title: Diagnostic Test Accuracy Meta-Analysis That Bridges 'meta' and HSROC Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person(given = "Jinquan", family = "Zhang", role = c("aut", "cre"), email = "jinquan_zhang_0607@163.com")
Author: Jinquan Zhang [aut, cre]
Maintainer: Jinquan Zhang <jinquan_zhang_0607@163.com>
Description: Reconstruct diagnostic 2x2 data from paired 'meta::metaprop'
    objects, create paired sensitivity/specificity forest plots, fit the
    Reitsma bivariate random-effects model, draw Rutter-Gatsonis HSROC curves,
    and calculate post-test probabilities.
